{"id":"sugriva-routes","type":"lines","flow":true,"float":true,"title":{"en":"Where the parties go","hi":"दल कहाँ जाते हैं"},"icon":"road","group":"culture","categories":[{"id":"east","title":{"en":"East: Vinata's party","hi":"पूर्व: विनत का दल"},"color":"#d08a2c"},{"id":"south","title":{"en":"South: Aṅgada's party","hi":"दक्षिण: अंगद का दल"},"color":"#b5432f"},{"id":"west","title":{"en":"West: Suṣeṇa's party","hi":"पश्चिम: सुषेण का दल"},"color":"#3f6f9e"},{"id":"north","title":{"en":"North: Śatabali's party","hi":"उत्तर: शतबलि का दल"},"color":"#6f8f3a"}],"fields":{"verse":{"type":"text","label":{"en":"As the verse has it","hi":"श्लोक में"}},"locus":{"type":"name","label":{"en":"Where","hi":"स्थान"}}},"arrows":true,"note":{"en":"Four arrows leave Kiṣkindhā, one per party. The others mark where the text itself goes on: the southern road that runs 'then … then' past Agastya to Mahendra and the island, and the ways out over the sea or the snow. An arrow is a diagram of the text, not a surveyed track.","hi":"किष्किन्धा से चार तीर निकलते हैं, हर दल का एक। बाक़ी वहाँ हैं जहाँ पाठ स्वयं आगे बढ़ता है: 'फिर … फिर' कहता दक्षिणी मार्ग जो अगस्त्य से होकर महेन्द्र और द्वीप तक जाता है, और समुद्र या हिम के पार के रास्ते। तीर पाठ का चित्र है, नापा हुआ रास्ता नहीं।"},"sources":["sa-wikisource"],"default_on":false,"count":11,"reviewed":0,"items":[{"id":"east-out","name":{"en":"Vinata's party sets out east","hi":"विनत का दल पूर्व की ओर"},"category":"east","rank":1,"lines":[[-687.3,764.8,-598.4,607.7,-490.7,435.8,-376.8,271.7,-256.7,115.0,-130.5,-34.5,1.7,-177.1,92.9,-266.9,119.4,-293.0,146.1,-318.8,173.7,-343.6,201.3,-368.5,228.9,-393.3,256.5,-418.2,284.1,-443.0]],"blurb":{"en":"Kiṣkindhā 40.19-24: the eastern quarter. From Kiṣkindhā to the Videhas, where the eastern list begins.","hi":"किष्किन्धाकाण्ड 40.19-24: पूर्व दिशा। किष्किन्धा से विदेह तक, जहाँ पूर्व की सूची आरंभ होती है।"},"sources":["https://sa.wikisource.org/wiki/रामायणम्/किष्किन्धाकाण्डम्/सर्गः_४०?oldid=353574"],"status":"draft","widths":[[2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,7.2,6.81,6.389,5.928,5.412,4.81,4.046,0.0]],"verse":"अधिगच्छ दिशं पूर्वां","locus":{"en":"Rāmāyaṇa 4.40.19-24","hi":"रामायण 4.40.19-24"}},{"id":"north-out","name":{"en":"Śatabali's party sets out north","hi":"शतबलि का दल उत्तर की ओर"},"category":"north","rank":1,"lines":[[-687.3,764.8,-699.7,613.2,-704.4,441.7,-699.1,271.8,-684.3,103.5,-660.3,-63.3,-627.5,-228.9,-607.8,-307.2,-598.7,-343.3,-589.7,-379.3,-579.6,-415.0,-568.8,-450.5,-558.0,-486.1,-547.2,-521.6,-536.4,-557.2]],"blurb":{"en":"Kiṣkindhā 43.4-13: the northern quarter.","hi":"किष्किन्धाकाण्ड 43.4-13: उत्तर दिशा।"},"sources":["https://sa.wikisource.org/wiki/रामायणम्/किष्किन्धाकाण्डम्/सर्गः_४३?oldid=353590"],"status":"draft","widths":[[2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,2.4,7.2,6.81,6.389,5.928,5.412,4.81,4.046,0.0]],"verse":"दिशं ह्युदीचीं विक्रान्तां हिमशैलावतंसिकाम्","locus":{"en":"Rāmāyaṇa 4.43.4-13","hi":"रामायण 4.43.4-13"}},{"id":"south-out","name":{"en":"Aṅgada's party sets out south","hi":"अंगद का दल दक्षिण की ओर"},"category":"south","rank":1,"lines":[[-687.3,764.8,-669.8,548.4,-627.0,325.2,-570.1,140.8,-558.7,105.5,-544.1,71.3,-529.4,37.2,-514.8,3.1,-500.2,-31.1,-485.6,-65.2,-471.0,-99.4]],"blurb":{"en":"Kiṣkindhā 41.6-12: the southern quarter. The southern list begins at the Vindhya, which lies north of Kiṣkindhā.","hi":"किष्किन्धाकाण्ड 41.6-12: दक्षिण दिशा। दक्षिण की सूची विंध्य से आरंभ होती है, जो किष्किन्धा के उत्तर में है।"},"sources":["https://sa.wikisource.org/wiki/रामायणम्/किष्किन्धाकाण्डम्/सर्गः_४१?oldid=353584"],"status":"draft","widths":[[2.4,2.4,2.4,7.2,6.81,6.389,5.928,5.412,4.81,4.046,0.0]],"verse":"दक्षिणां दिशम्","locus":{"en":"Rāmāyaṇa 4.41.6-12","hi":"रामायण 4.41.6-12"}},{"id":"west-out","name":{"en":"Suṣeṇa's party sets out west","hi":"सुषेण का दल पश्चिम की ओर"},"category":"west","rank":1,"lines":[[-687.3,764.8,-857.5,605.1,-938.3,512.8,-1012.3,415.6,-1079.5,313.8,-1133.9,217.7,-1150.1,184.3,-1165.1,150.4,-1180.2,116.4,-1195.3,82.5,-1210.4,48.5,-